{"id":"n14468-2-7","stage":2,"title":"띄다 · 突出","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14468-2-7-1","ko":"민준이가 눈에 띄게 의욕을 잃은 모습이야.","zh":"敏俊看起来明显失去了干劲啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"눈에","meaning":"眼光，眼力，洞察力","explanation":"눈：眼光，眼力，洞察力；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"3","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"띄게","meaning":"突出，显示","explanation":"띄다：突出，显示；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"띄다","audio":"/audio/40a0dc104ee774d011f5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14468","senseId":"2","lemma":"띄다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"의욕을","meaning":"意欲","explanation":"의욕：意欲；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"의욕","audio":"/audio/a855c939eab90589718a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24094","senseId":"1","lemma":"의욕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잃은","meaning":"失去","explanation":"잃다：失去；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잃다","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17177","senseId":"7","lemma":"잃다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모습이야.","meaning":"样子，景象，状况","explanation":"모습：样子，景象，状况；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"모습","audio":"/audio/4b8858fa4bec51bc3aa6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62383","senseId":"2","lemma":"모습","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼光，眼力，洞察力","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"观察判断事物的能力。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"40a0dc104ee774d0","term":"띄다","zh":"突出，显示","audio":"/audio/40a0dc104ee774d011f5.mp3","entryId":"14468","definition":"某种状态比平时看上去更明显。","pronunciation":["띠ː다"]},{"id":"a855c939eab90589","term":"의욕","zh":"意欲","audio":"/audio/a855c939eab90589718a.mp3","entryId":"24094","definition":"想做某事的积极的想法或意志。","pronunciation":["의ː욕"]},{"id":"03ebbd29f2834d52","term":"잃다","zh":"失去","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3","entryId":"17177","definition":"意识、感情、精力或生理现象等消失。","pronunciation":["일타"]},{"id":"4b8858fa4bec51bc","term":"모습","zh":"样子，景象，状况","audio":"/audio/4b8858fa4bec51bc3aa6.mp3","entryId":"62383","definition":"表露于外的状态或形貌。","pronunciation":["모습"]}],"audio":"/audio/728d12fdc26f3e03eb38.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14468-2-7-2","ko":"어제 엄마에게 심하게 혼났대.","zh":"听说他昨天被妈妈狠狠训斥了一顿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄마에게","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"심하게","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심하다：严重；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혼났대.","meaning":"被大骂，被怒斥","explanation":"혼나다：被大骂，被怒斥；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"혼나다","audio":"/audio/b4d47e56735ffcb5a8a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87966","senseId":"2","lemma":"혼나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。",